#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:428
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Plasma"
msgstr "Configurando Plasma"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:431
#, xml-text
msgid "Linux PAM Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Linux PAM"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:434
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built Plasma with the recommended <application>Linux "
"PAM</application> support, create necessary configuration files by running "
"the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu o Plasma com o suporte <application>Linux "
"PAM</application> recomendado, crie os necessários arquivos de configuração "
"executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:440
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kde &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kde\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     include        system-auth\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kde</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kde-np &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kde-np\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     required       pam_permit.so\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kde-np</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver\n"
"\n"
"auth    include system-auth\n"
"account include system-account\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kde &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kde\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     include        system-auth\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kde</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kde-np &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kde-np\n"
"\n"
"auth     requisite      pam_nologin.so\n"
"auth     required       pam_env.so\n"
"\n"
"auth     required       pam_succeed_if.so uid &gt;= 1000 quiet\n"
"auth     required       pam_permit.so\n"
"\n"
"account  include        system-account\n"
"password include        system-password\n"
"session  include        system-session\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kde-np</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver\n"
"\n"
"auth    include system-auth\n"
"account include system-account\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/pam.d/kscreensaver</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:484
#, xml-text
msgid "Starting Plasma"
msgstr "Iniciando o Plasma"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:487
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can start <application>Plasma</application> from runlevel 3, using <xref"
" linkend=\"xinit\"/>, or from runlevel 5, using a Display Manager, such as "
"<xref linkend=\"lightdm\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Você consegue iniciar o <application>Plasma</application> a partir do nível "
"de execução 3, usando o <xref linkend=\"xinit\"/>, ou a partir do nível de "
"execução 5, usando um Gerenciador de Tela, como o <xref "
"linkend=\"lightdm\"/>."

#. , or from a graphical display manager, such as
#.       <xref linkend="sddm"/>
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:493
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can start <application>Plasma</application> from a TTY, using <xref "
"linkend=\"xinit\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Você consegue iniciar o <application>Plasma</application> a partir de um "
"TTY, usando o <xref linkend=\"xinit\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:499
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start <application>Plasma</application> using <xref linkend=\"xinit\"/>, "
"run the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o <application>Plasma</application> usando o <xref "
"linkend=\"xinit\"/>, execute os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:503
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>dbus-launch --exit-with-x11 $KF6_PREFIX/bin/startplasma-x11</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"startx</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.xinitrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>dbus-launch --exit-with-x11 $KF6_PREFIX/bin/startplasma-x11</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"startx</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:510
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The X session starts on the first unused virtual terminal, normally vt7.  "
"You can switch to another vt<emphasis>n</emphasis> simultaneously pressing "
"the keys Ctrl-Alt-F<emphasis>n</emphasis> (<emphasis>n</emphasis>=1, 2, "
"...).  To switch back to the X session, normally started at vt7, use Ctrl-"
"Alt-F7. The vt where the command <command>startx</command> was executed will"
" display many messages, including X starting messages, applications "
"automatically started with the session, and eventually, some warning and "
"error messages. You may prefer to redirect those messages to a log file, "
"which not only will keep the initial vt uncluttered, but can also be used "
"for debugging purposes. This can be done starting X with:"
msgstr ""
"A sessão do X inicia no primeiro terminal virtual não usado, normalmente o "
"vt7. Você consegue comutar para outro vt<emphasis>n</emphasis> pressionando "
"simultaneamente as teclas Ctrl-Alt-F<emphasis>n</emphasis> "
"(<emphasis>n</emphasis>=1, 2, ...). Para comutar de volta para a sessão do "
"X, normalmente iniciada no vt7, use Ctrl-Alt-F7. O vt onde o comando "
"<command>startx</command> foi executado exibirá muitas mensagens, incluindo "
"mensagens de iniciação do X, aplicativos iniciados automaticamente com a "
"sessão e, eventualmente, algumas mensagens de aviso e erro. Você "
"possivelmente prefira redirecionar essas mensagens para um arquivo de "
"registro, que não apenas manterá o vt inicial organizado, mas também poderá "
"ser usado para fins de depuração. Isso pode ser feito iniciando-se o X com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:523
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>startx &amp;&gt; ~/x-session-errors</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>startx &amp;&gt; ~/x-session-errors</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/plasma/plasma-all.xml:526
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"When shutting down or rebooting, the shutdown messages appear on the vt "
"where X was running. If you wish to see those messages, simultaneously press"
" keys Alt-F7 (assuming that X was running on vt7)."
msgstr ""
"Ao desligar ou reinicializar, as mensagens de desligamento aparecem no "
"terminal virtual onde o X estava executando. Se você desejar ver essas "
"mensagens, pressione simultaneamente as teclas Alt-F7 (assumindo que o X "
"estava executando no terminal virtual 7)."

